property_value: IAO:0000112 "Examples are articles published in the journals, Nature and Science. The content can often be cited by reference to a paper based encoding, e.g.  Authors, Title of article, Journal name, date or year of publication, volume and page number." xsd:string
property_value: IAO:0000114 IAO:0000120
property_value: IAO:0000117 "PERSON: Alan Ruttenberg" xsd:string
property_value: IAO:0000117 "PERSON: Chris Stoeckert" xsd:string
